g time, there is a slight time difference on\r\n                                    our web tracing result.</li>\r\n                                <li>Information for the segments transferred by truck or other airline may not be\r\n                                    displayed in the tracing result.</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class="acodBlock">\r\n                        <p class="heading tglSld_iconRD close JS_tglSldP">\r\n                            <span class="inr">J PRODUCTS</span>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        <div class="content JS_tglSldC" style="display: none;">\r\n                            <ul class="listA">\r\n                                <li>In addition to the Web Shipment Tracing service you\r\n                                    have just used, you can also use JTMS(JAL CARGO TRACING MAIL SERVICE), our\r\n                                    innovative e-mail tracing service.</li>\r\n                                <li>With JTMS, you\'ll automatically receive e-mail updates every time there is a\r\n                                    change in the status of your shipment, allowing you to monitor the movement of your\r\n                                    shipment on a real-time basis.</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n                            <ul class="btnUnit">\r\n                                <li class="btnJTms last">\r\n                                    <a href="http://www.jal.co.jp/en/jalcargo/inter/jproducts/jtms.html">\r\n                                        <img src="/JalCargoWeb/common/sp/img/en/btn_about_jtms_n.png" alt="JTMS">\r\n                                    </a>\r\n                                </li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n                            <ul class="noteList alR mgr10">\r\n                                <li><span class="listMark">※</span>PC pa